(148, 'Lembaga Negara Kolonial (Departementen van Algemene Bestuur (1854-1942)', 'Colonial State Institutions (Departementen van Algemene Bestuur (1854-1942)', 'link', 147, '/periode-hindia-belanda/lembaga-negara-kolonial-departementen-van-algemene-bestuur-1854-1942', 1, '<div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"daftar-arsip-lembaga-negara-kolonial-departementen-van-algemene-bestuur-1854-19421-algemene-secretarie-1812-1942\" id=\"daftar-arsip-lembaga-negara-kolonial-departementen-van-algemene-bestuur-1854-19421-algemene-secretarie-1812-1942\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"daftar-arsip-lembaga-negara-kolonial-departementen-van-algemene-bestuur-1854-1942\" id=\"daftar-arsip-lembaga-negara-kolonial-departementen-van-algemene-bestuur-1854-1942\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Daftar Arsip Lembaga Negara Kolonial (Departementen van Algemene Bestuur (1854-1942)</span><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"1-algemene-secretarie-1812-1942\" id=\"1-algemene-secretarie-1812-1942\"><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">1.&nbsp;Algemene Secretarie (1812-1942)</span></p></div><p data-rte-anchor=\"algemeene-secretarie-archives-of-the-general-secretariat-period-1817-1941-app-3230-m\" id=\"algemeene-secretarie-archives-of-the-general-secretariat-period-1817-1941-app-3230-m\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">ALGEMEENE SECRETARIE (Archives of the General Secretariat)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: inherit;\">period: 1817-1941; app. 3,230 m³.</span></p></div><div><!--StartFragment--><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e75376d8-7fff-01b7-3665-9256a2d62322\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"\" align=\"left\"><table style=\"border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; table-layout: fixed; min-width: 0px; width: 100%;\" class=\"rte-table\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"archives-of-the-office-of-the-general-secretariat\" id=\"archives-of-the-office-of-the-general-secretariat\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Archives of the office of the General Secretariat&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"arsip-sekretariat-negara-kolonial-hindia-belanda\" id=\"arsip-sekretariat-negara-kolonial-hindia-belanda\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Arsip Sekretariat Negara Kolonial Hindia Belanda</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"archives-of-the-office-of-the-general-secretariat-are-divided-into\" id=\"archives-of-the-office-of-the-general-secretariat-are-divided-into\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Archives of the office of the General Secretariat are divided into :</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"besluiten-decrees\" id=\"besluiten-decrees\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Besluiten (Decrees)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"geheime-besluiten-secret-decrees\" id=\"geheime-besluiten-secret-decrees\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Geheime Besluiten (Secret Decrees)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"resolutien-resolutions\" id=\"resolutien-resolutions\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Resolutien (Resolutions)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"missiven-gouvernements-secretaris-official-letters-of-the-government-secretary-initialled-as-mgs\" id=\"missiven-gouvernements-secretaris-official-letters-of-the-government-secretary-initialled-as-mgs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Missiven Gouvernements Secretaris (Official Letters of the Government Secretary), initialled as M.G.S.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"brieven-gouvernements-secretaris-letters-of-the-government-secretary-initialled-as-bgs\" id=\"brieven-gouvernements-secretaris-letters-of-the-government-secretary-initialled-as-bgs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Brieven Gouvernements Secretaris (Letters of the Government Secretary), initialled as B.G.S.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"agenda-agenda\" id=\"agenda-agenda\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Agenda (Agenda)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"kabinet-cabinet\" id=\"kabinet-cabinet\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">*Kabinet (Cabinet)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"telegrammen-gouvernements-secretaris-telegrams-of-the-government-secretary-initialled-as-tgs\" id=\"telegrammen-gouvernements-secretaris-telegrams-of-the-government-secretary-initialled-as-tgs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Telegrammen Gouvernements Secretaris (Telegrams of the Government Secretary), initialled as T.G.S.</span></p><br></td><td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"arsip-kantor-sekretariat-dibagi-menjadi\" id=\"arsip-kantor-sekretariat-dibagi-menjadi\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Arsip Kantor Sekretariat dibagi menjadi:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"besluiten-keputusan-biasa\" id=\"besluiten-keputusan-biasa\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Besluiten (Keputusan [Biasa])</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"geheime-besluiten-keputusan-rahasia\" id=\"geheime-besluiten-keputusan-rahasia\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Geheime Besluiten (Keputusan Rahasia)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"resolutien-resolusi\" id=\"resolutien-resolusi\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Resolutien (Resolusi)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"missiven-gouvernements-secretaris-surat-resmi-sekretaris-pemerintahan-disingkat-mgs\" id=\"missiven-gouvernements-secretaris-surat-resmi-sekretaris-pemerintahan-disingkat-mgs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Missiven Gouvernements Secretaris (Surat Resmi Sekretaris Pemerintahan), disingkat M.G.S.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"surat-surat-sekretaris-pemerintah-brieven-gouvernements-secretaris-disingkat-bgs\" id=\"surat-surat-sekretaris-pemerintah-brieven-gouvernements-secretaris-disingkat-bgs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Surat-surat Sekretaris Pemerintah (Brieven Gouvernements Secretaris), disingkat B.G.S.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"agenda-agenda-27-1\" id=\"agenda-agenda-27-1\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Agenda (Agenda)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"kabinet-kabinet\" id=\"kabinet-kabinet\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">*Kabinet (Kabinet)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"telegram-telegram-sekretaris-pemerintah-telegrammen-gouvernements-secretaris-disingkat-tgs\" id=\"telegram-telegram-sekretaris-pemerintah-telegrammen-gouvernements-secretaris-disingkat-tgs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Telegram-telegram Sekretaris Pemerintah (Telegrammen Gouvernements Secretaris), disingkat T.G.S.</span></p><br><br></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"for-finding-aids-consult-also-the-index-folio-klapper-of-the-algemeene-secretarie-collection\" id=\"for-finding-aids-consult-also-the-index-folio-klapper-of-the-algemeene-secretarie-collection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">For finding aids consult also the Index Folio, Klapper of the \"Algemeene Secretarie\" collection.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"the-algemeene-secretarie-as-the-bureau-of-the-governor-general-of-the-netherlands-indies-was-officially-managed-since-the-beginning-of-1819-derived-from-two-offices-ie-generaal-secretarijof-the-former-commissaris-generaal-and-gouvernements-secretarij-governor-general-of-the\" id=\"the-algemeene-secretarie-as-the-bureau-of-the-governor-general-of-the-netherlands-indies-was-officially-managed-since-the-beginning-of-1819-derived-from-two-offices-ie-generaal-secretarijof-the-former-commissaris-generaal-and-gouvernements-secretarij-governor-general-of-the\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The \"Algemeene Secretarie\" as the bureau of the Governor-General of the Netherlands Indies was officially managed since the beginning of 1819, derived from two offices, i.e. \"Generaal Secretarij\"of the former Commissaris-Generaal, and \"Gouvernements Secretarij\" Governor-General. of the</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"the-bureau-served-as-vade-mecum-and-information-giver-to-the-government-taking-care-of-the-custody-of-decrees-issued-by-the-governor-general\" id=\"the-bureau-served-as-vade-mecum-and-information-giver-to-the-government-taking-care-of-the-custody-of-decrees-issued-by-the-governor-general\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The bureau served as vade-mecum and information-giver to the government, taking care of the custody of decrees issued by the Governor-General.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"the-staatsblad-van-nederlandsch-indie-and-the-almanak-voor-nederlandsch-indie-publications-secretarie-regeerings-both-are-government-were-compiled-and-issued-by-the-algemeene\" id=\"the-staatsblad-van-nederlandsch-indie-and-the-almanak-voor-nederlandsch-indie-publications-secretarie-regeerings-both-are-gover