ormation-giver-to-the-government-taking-care-of-the-custody-of-decrees-issued-by-the-governor-general\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The bureau served as vade-mecum and information-giver to the government, taking care of the custody of decrees issued by the Governor-General.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"the-staatsblad-van-nederlandsch-indie-and-the-almanak-voor-nederlandsch-indie-publications-secretarie-regeerings-both-are-government-were-compiled-and-issued-by-the-algemeene\" id=\"the-staatsblad-van-nederlandsch-indie-and-the-almanak-voor-nederlandsch-indie-publications-secretarie-regeerings-both-are-government-were-compiled-and-issued-by-the-algemeene\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The \"Staatsblad van Nederlandsch-Indie\" and the Almanac for Nederlandsch-Indie \" publications Secretarie \". Regeerings both are government were compiled and issued by the \"Algemeene</span></p><br></td><td style=\"border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"untuk-alat-bantu-pencarian-silakan-merujuk-juga-ke-index-folio-klapper-dari-koleksi-algemeene-secretarie\" id=\"untuk-alat-bantu-pencarian-silakan-merujuk-juga-ke-index-folio-klapper-dari-koleksi-algemeene-secretarie\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">For a finding aid, please refer also to the Index Folio, Klapper of the collection \"Algemeene Secretarie\".</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"algemeene-secretarie-sebagai-biro-gubernur-jenderal-hindia-belanda-secara-resmi-dikelola-sejak-awal-tahun-1819-yang-berasal-dari-dua-kantor-yaitu-generaal-secretarij-dari-mantan-commissaris-generaal-dan-gouvernements-secretarij-gubernur-jenderal\" id=\"algemeene-secretarie-sebagai-biro-gubernur-jenderal-hindia-belanda-secara-resmi-dikelola-sejak-awal-tahun-1819-yang-berasal-dari-dua-kantor-yaitu-generaal-secretarij-dari-mantan-commissaris-generaal-dan-gouvernements-secretarij-gubernur-jenderal\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">\"Algemeene Secretarie\" as the bureau of the Governor General of the Dutch East Indies was officially managed since the beginning of 1819, originating from two offices, namely \"Generaal Secretarij\" from the former Commissaris-Generaal, and \"Gouvernements Secretarij\" of the Governor General.</span></p><br><br><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"kantor-ini-berfungsi-sebagai-panduan-dan-penyedia-informasi-bagi-pemerintah-serta-bertanggung-jawab-atas-penyimpanan-keputusan-keputusan-yang-dikeluarkan-oleh-gubernur-jenderal\" id=\"kantor-ini-berfungsi-sebagai-panduan-dan-penyedia-informasi-bagi-pemerintah-serta-bertanggung-jawab-atas-penyimpanan-keputusan-keputusan-yang-dikeluarkan-oleh-gubernur-jenderal\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">This office functions as a guide and information provider for the government, and is responsible for the storage of decisions issued by the Governor General.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\" data-rte-anchor=\"publikasi-staatsblad-van-nederlandsch-indie-d