-dan-beragam-subjek-lain-seperti-pertambangan-pertanahan-dan-kolonisasi\"><span><div style=\"max-height:189px\" data-rte-anchor=\"24-bijzondere-verslagenarsip-di-bagian-ini-merupakan-kumpulan-laporan-insidental-yang-ditujukan-kepada-gubernur-jenderal-secara-umum-laporan-laporan-tersebut-terbagi-ke-dalam-bidang-bidang-tertentu-seperti-bestuur-pemerintahan-economische-zaken-urusan-ekonomi-landbouw-pertanian-openbare-werken-pekerjaan-umum-openbare-orde-ketertiban-umum-militaire-zaken-urusan-militer-dan-beragam-subjek-lain-seperti-pertambangan-pertanahan-dan-kolonisasi-123-1\" id=\"24-bijzondere-verslagenarsip-di-bagian-ini-merupakan-kumpulan-laporan-insidental-yang-ditujukan-kepada-gubernur-jenderal-secara-umum-laporan-laporan-tersebut-terbagi-ke-dalam-bidang-bidang-tertentu-seperti-bestuur-pemerintahan-economische-zaken-urusan-ekonomi-landbouw-pertanian-openbare-werken-pekerjaan-umum-openbare-orde-ketertiban-umum-militaire-zaken-urusan-militer-dan-beragam-subjek-lain-seperti-pertambangan-pertanahan-dan-kolonisasi-123-1\">2.4. Bijzondere verslagen<br>The archives in this section are a collection of incidental reports addressed to the Governor General. In general, these reports are divided into certain fields such as bestuur (government), economische zaken (economic affairs), landbouw (agriculture), openbare werken (public works), openbare orde (public order), militaire zaken (military affairs), and various other subjects such as mining, land, and colonization.</div></span></td><td style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow: hidden; padding: 2px 3px; vertical-align: top; font-size: 12pt; overflow-wrap: break-word\" rowspan=\"4\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"\" data-rte-anchor=\"2412-reorganisatie-van-het-binnenlands-bestuur-arsip-di-bagian-ini-nomor-arsip-395-403-merupakan-kesatuan-berkas-penelitian-yang-dilakukan-oleh-anggota-raad-van-nederlands-indi-j-mullemeister-mengenai-riset-di-tingkat-lokal-terkait-reorganisasi-pemerintahan-dalam-negeri-yang-paling-sesuai-dan-aplikatif-di-wilayah-jawa-dan-madura-kecuali-vorstenlanden-dari-perspektif-finansial-dan-kepemerintahan-arsip-milik-j-mullemeister-bercampur-dengan-arsip-yang-berkaitan-dengannya-yang-diterima-algemene-secretarie\" id=\"2412-reorganisatie-van-het-binnenlands-bestuur-arsip-di-bagian-ini-nomor-arsip-395-403-merupakan-kesatuan-berkas-penelitian-yang-dilakukan-oleh-anggota-raad-van-nederlands-indi-j-mullemeister-mengenai-riset-di-tingkat-lokal-terkait-reorganisasi-pemerintahan-dalam-negeri-yang-paling-sesuai-dan-aplikatif-di-wilayah-jawa-dan-madura-kecuali-vorstenlanden-dari-perspektif-finansial-dan-kepemerintahan-arsip-milik-j-mullemeister-bercampur-dengan-arsip-yang-berkaitan-dengannya-yang-diterima-algemene-secretarie\"><span><div style=\"max-height:84px\" data-rte-anchor=\"2412-reorganisatie-van-het-binnenlands-bestuur-arsip-di-bagian-ini-nomor-arsip-395-403-merupakan-kesatuan-berkas-penelitian-yang-dilakukan-oleh-anggota-raad-van-nederlands-indi-j-mullemeister-mengenai-riset-di-tingkat-lokal-terkait-reorganisasi-pemerintahan-dalam-negeri-yang-paling-sesuai-dan-aplikatif-di-wilayah-jawa-dan-madura-kecuali-vorstenlanden-dari-perspektif-finansial-dan-kepemerintahan-arsip-milik-j-mullemeister-bercampur-dengan-arsip-yang-berkaitan-dengannya-yang-diterima-algemene-secretarie-125-1\" id=\"2412-reorganisatie-van-het-binnenlands-bestuur-arsip-di-bagian-ini-nomor-arsip-395-403-merupakan-kesatuan-berkas-penelitian-yang-dilakukan-oleh-anggota-raad-van-nederlands-indi-j-mullemeister-mengenai-riset-di-tingkat-lokal-terkait-reorganisasi-pemerintahan-dalam-negeri-yang-paling-sesuai-dan-aplikatif-di-wilayah-jawa-dan-madura-kecuali-vorstenlanden-dari-perspektif-finansial-dan-kepemerintahan-arsip-milik-j-mullemeister-bercampur-dengan-arsip-yang-berkaitan-dengannya-yang-diterima-algemene-secretarie-125-1\">2.4.1.2. Reorganisatie van het Binnenlands Bestuur\r\n<br>The archives in this section (file number 395-403) are a collection of research files carried out by a member of Raad van Nederlands Indië, J. Mullemeister, regarding research at the local level regarding the most appropriate and applicable domestic government reorganization in the Java and Madura regions (except Vorstenlanden) from a financial and governmental perspective. J. Mullemeister\'s archives are mixed with related archives received by the Algemene Secretarie. 1892.<br>Report on the areas of Kedu, Banyumas, Besuki, Pasuruan, Tegal, Krawang, Madiun, Cirebon, Priangan, Kediri, Rembang, Madura, Banten, Jepara, 1892.</td><td style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow: hidden; padding: 2px 3px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 12pt; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: center\" class=\"\" data-rte-anchor=\"section-127-1\" id=\"section-127-1\">-</td><td style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow: hidden; padding: 2px 3px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 12pt; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: center\" class=\"\" data-rte-anchor=\"section-128-1\" id=\"section-128-1\">-</td><td style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow: hidden; padding: 2px 3px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 12pt; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: center\" class=\"\" data-rte-anchor=\"1-omslag-129-1\" id=\"1-omslag-129-1\">1 Omslag</td><td style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow: hidden; padding: 2px 3px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 12pt; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: center\" class=\"\" data-rte-anchor=\"goed-130-1\" id=\"goed-130-1\">Goed</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-left: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow: hidden; padding: 2px 3px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 12pt; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: center\" class=\"\" data-rte-anchor=\"10\" id=\