ngga-1937-arsip-arsip-tersebut-merinci-perencanaan-teknis-dan-pemeliharaan-bangunan-pemerintah-serta-fasilitas-penunjang-bagi-personel-militer-saat-itu-melalui-berbagai-jenis-infrastruktur-vital-seperti-benteng-barak-tentara-gudang-amunisi-serta-instalasi-penerangan-listrik-di-berbagai-wilayah-strategis-setiap-entri-menyediakan-informasi-teknis-mendalam-yang-meliputi-rincian-fisik-dokumen-termasuk-media-kertas-format-tulisan-tangan-serta-status-keaslian-berkas-yang-disimpan-gambar-denah-skala-konstruksi-dan-lokasi-spesifik-bangunan-di-kota-kota-seperti-cimahi-batavia-dan-bandung\" id=\"dokumentasi-arsitektural-militer-dari-departemen-perang-hindia-belanda-yang-mencakup-periode-antara-tahun-1818-hingga-1937-arsip-arsip-tersebut-merinci-perencanaan-teknis-dan-pemeliharaan-bangunan-pemerintah-serta-fasilitas-penunjang-bagi-personel-militer-saat-itu-melalui-berbagai-jenis-infrastruktur-vital-seperti-benteng-barak-tentara-gudang-amunisi-serta-instalasi-penerangan-listrik-di-berbagai-wilayah-strategis-setiap-entri-menyediakan-informasi-teknis-mendalam-yang-meliputi-rincian-fisik-dokumen-termasuk-media-kertas-format-tulisan-tangan-serta-status-keaslian-berkas-yang-disimpan-gambar-denah-skala-konstruksi-dan-lokasi-spesifik-bangunan-di-kota-kota-seperti-cimahi-batavia-dan-bandung\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Military architectural documentation from the Dutch East Indies War Department covering the period between 1818 and 1937. These archives detail the technical planning and maintenance of government buildings and supporting facilities for military personnel at that time through </span><span style=\"color: inherit;\">various types of vital infrastructure such as forts, army barracks, ammunition depots, as well as electric lighting installations in various strategic areas. Each entry provides in-depth technical information covering the physical details of the document, including the paper medium, handwriting format, as well as the authenticity status of the stored file. floor plans, construction scale, and specific locations of buildings in cities such as Cimahi, Batavia, and Bandung. </span></p></div></div><div data-rte-anchor=\"a-kr3a-daftar-arsip-kearsitekturan-dept-van-oorlog-1804-1939-fa-anri-tematisb-kr3b-daftar-arsip-kearsitekturan-dept-van-oorlog-seri-bangunan-militer-1818-1937-fa-anri-tematisc-kr-5-daftar-arsip-statis-kearsitekturan-departement-van-oorlog-1817-1936-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-kr3a-daftar-arsip-kearsitekturan-dept-van-oorlog-1804-1939-fa-anri-tematisb-kr3b-daftar-arsip-kearsitekturan-dept-van-oorlog-seri-bangunan-militer-1818-1937-fa-anri-tematisc-kr-5-daftar-arsip-statis-kearsitekturan-departement-van-oorlog-1817-1936-fa-anri-tematis\"><div data-rte-anchor=\"a-kr3a-daftar-arsip-kearsitekturan-dept-van-oorlog-1804-1939-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-kr3a-daftar-arsip-kearsitekturan-dept-van-oorlog-1804-1939-fa-anri-tematis\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"a-kr3a-daftar-arsip-kearsitekturan-dept-van-oorlog-1804-1939-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-kr3a-daftar-arsip-kearsitekturan-dept-van-oorlog-1804-1939-fa-anri-tematis\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">a. KR.3.A List of Architectural Archives Dept van Oorlog 1804-1939 [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"b-kr3b-daftar-arsip-kearsitekturan-dept-van-oorlog-seri-bangunan-militer-1818-1937-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"b-kr3b-daftar-arsip-kearsitekturan-dept-van-oorlog-seri-bangunan-militer-1818-1937-fa-anri-tematis\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">b. KR.3.B List of Architectural Archives Dept van Oorlog series Military Buildings 1818-1937 [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"c-kr-5-daftar-arsip-statis-kearsitekturan-departement-van-oorlog-1817-1936-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"c-kr-5-daftar-arsip-statis-kearsitekturan-departement-van-oorlog-1817-1936-fa-anri-tematis\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">c. KR 5. List of Architectural Static Archives of the Department of Van Oorlog (1817-1936) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p></div></div></div></span><!--EndFragment--></div>', 0, 'none', 'none', 1, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-07 07:32:17', '2026-06-07 12:43:20');
