; line-height: 23.4667px;\" data-rte-anchor=\"14-dr-andi-makmur-makka-msi-1965-2009\" id=\"14-dr-andi-makmur-makka-msi-1965-2009\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"14-dr-andi-makmur-makka-msi-1965-2009\" id=\"14-dr-andi-makmur-makka-msi-1965-2009\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Inter, Poppins, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">14.&nbsp;Dr. Andi Makmur Makka, M.Si.&nbsp;(1965-2009)</span></b></p></div><div data-rte-anchor=\"a-rb-18-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-andi-makmur-makka-1965-2009-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-rb-18-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-andi-makmur-makka-1965-2009-fa-anri-tematis\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"a-rb-18-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-andi-makmur-makka-1965-2009-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-rb-18-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-andi-makmur-makka-1965-2009-fa-anri-tematis\">a. RB 18. Inventaris Arsip Tekstual Andi Makmur Makka (1965-2009) [FA ANRI] [TEMATIS]</p></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 23.4667px;\" data-rte-anchor=\"15-prof-dr-ing-h-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-freng-1959-2010\" id=\"15-prof-dr-ing-h-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-freng-1959-2010\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"15-prof-dr-ing-h-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-freng-1959-2010-tekstual\" id=\"15-prof-dr-ing-h-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-freng-1959-2010-tekstual\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Inter, Poppins, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">15.&nbsp;Prof. Dr. Ing. H. Bacharuddin Jusuf Habibie, FREng. (1959-2010) Tekstual</span></b></p></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"berisi-kunjungan-diplomatik-pemimpin-dunia-seperti-dari-yugoslavia-australia-dan-papua-nugini-yang-sering-kali-disertai-dengan-pertunjukan-seni-budaya-khas-jawa-barat-selain-diplomasi-sumber-ini-mencatat-momen-penting-industrialisasi-dan-infrastruktur-termasuk-peresmian-pabrik-baja-krakatau-steel-pembangkit-listrik-tenaga-panas-bumi-serta-peluncuran-pesawat-cn-235-roll-out-n-250-di-bandung-1994\" id=\"berisi-kunjungan-diplomatik-pemimpin-dunia-seperti-dari-yugoslavia-australia-dan-papua-nugini-yang-sering-kali-disertai-dengan-pertunjukan-seni-budaya-khas-jawa-barat-selain-diplomasi-sumber-ini-mencatat-momen-penting-industrialisasi-dan-infrastruktur-termasuk-peresmian-pabrik-baja-krakatau-steel-pembangkit-listrik-tenaga-panas-bumi-serta-peluncuran-pesawat-cn-235-roll-out-n-250-di-bandung-1994\">Berisi kunjungan diplomatik pemimpin dunia, seperti dari Yugoslavia, Australia, dan Papua Nugini, yang sering kali disertai dengan pertunjukan seni budaya khas Jawa Barat. Selain diplomasi, sumber ini mencatat momen penting industrialisasi dan infrastruktur, termasuk peresmian pabrik baja Krakatau Steel, pembangkit listrik tenaga panas bumi, serta peluncuran pesawat CN-235 (Roll-Out N-250 di Bandung, 1994).&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"a-rb-17-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-1959-2010-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-rb-17-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-1959-2010-fa-anri-tematis\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">a. RB 17. Inventaris Arsip Tekstual Bacharuddin Jusuf Habibie (1959-2010) [FA ANRI] [TEMATIS]</span></p><div data-rte-anchor=\"a-rb-17-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-1959-2010-fa-anri-tematis-47-1\" id=\"a-rb-17-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-1959-2010-fa-anri-tematis-47-1\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 23.4667px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"16-prof-dr-ing-h-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-freng-1959-2010-video\" id=\"16-prof-dr-ing-h-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-freng-1959-2010-video\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Inter, Poppins, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">16. Prof. Dr. Ing. H. Bacharuddin Jusuf Habibie, FREng.&nbsp;</span></b><b style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; color: inherit;\">(1959 - 2010) Video</b></p></div><