ans-serif;\">a. RA 90. Inventory of Textual Archives of the Republic of Indonesia State Secretariat (SETNEG RI) Mrs. Tien Soeharto\'s Speech Series (1968-1996) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 23.4667px;\" data-rte-anchor=\"13-guruh-irianto-sukarnoputra-1973-1990\" id=\"13-guruh-irianto-sukarnoputra-1973-1990\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"13-guruh-irianto-sukarnoputra-1973-1990\" id=\"13-guruh-irianto-sukarnoputra-1973-1990\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Inter, Poppins, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">13. Guruh Irianto Sukarnoputra (1973-1990)</span></b></p></div><div data-rte-anchor=\"a-rb-16-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-guruh-sukarno-putra-1973-1990-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-rb-16-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-guruh-sukarno-putra-1973-1990-fa-anri-tematis\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"a-rb-16-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-guruh-sukarno-putra-1973-1990-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-rb-16-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-guruh-sukarno-putra-1973-1990-fa-anri-tematis\">a.  RB 16. Inventory of Guruh Sukarno Putra\'s Textual Archives (1973-1990) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</p></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 23.4667px;\" data-rte-anchor=\"14-dr-andi-makmur-makka-msi-1965-2009\" id=\"14-dr-andi-makmur-makka-msi-1965-2009\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"14-dr-andi-makmur-makka-msi-1965-2009\" id=\"14-dr-andi-makmur-makka-msi-1965-2009\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Inter, Poppins, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">14. Dr. Andi Makmur Makka, M.Si. (1965-2009)</span></b></p></div><div data-rte-anchor=\"a-rb-18-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-andi-makmur-makka-1965-2009-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-rb-18-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-andi-makmur-makka-1965-2009-fa-anri-tematis\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"a-rb-18-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-andi-makmur-makka-1965-2009-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-rb-18-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-andi-makmur-makka-1965-2009-fa-anri-tematis\">a. RB 18. Inventory of Andi Makmur Makka\'s Textual Archives (1965-2009) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</p></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 23.4667px;\" data-rte-anchor=\"15-prof-dr-ing-h-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-freng-1959-2010\" id=\"15-prof-dr-ing-h-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-freng-1959-2010\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"15-prof-dr-ing-h-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-freng-1959-2010-tekstual\" id=\"15-prof-dr-ing-h-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-freng-1959-2010-tekstual\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Inter, Poppins, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">15. Prof. Dr. Eng. H. Bacharuddin Jusuf Habibie, FREng. (1959-2010) Textual</span></b></p></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"berisi-kunjungan-diplomatik-pemimpin-dunia-seperti-dari-yugoslavia-australia-dan-papua-nugini-yang-sering-kali-disertai-dengan-pertunjukan-seni-budaya-khas-jawa-barat-selain-diplomasi-sumber-ini-mencatat-momen-penting-industrialisasi-dan-infrastruktur-termasuk-peresmian-pabrik-baja-krakatau-steel-pembangkit-listrik-tenaga-panas-bumi-serta-peluncuran-pesawat-cn-235-roll-out-n-250-di-bandung-1994\" id=\"berisi-kunjungan-diplomatik-pemimpin-dunia-seperti-dari-yugoslavia-australia-dan-papua-nugini-yang-sering-kali-disertai-dengan-pertunjukan-seni-budaya-khas-jawa-barat-selain-diplomasi-sumber-ini-mencatat-momen-penting-industrialisasi-dan-infrastruktur-termasuk-peresmian-pabrik-baja-krakatau-steel-pembangkit-listrik-tenaga-panas-bumi-serta-peluncuran-pesawat-cn-235-roll-out-n-250-di-bandung-1994\">Contains diplomatic visits from world leaders, such as those from Yugoslavia, Australia and Papua New Guinea, which are often accompanied by performances of West Javanese cultural arts. Apart from diplomacy, this source records important moments of industrialization and infrastructure, including the inauguration of the Krakatau Steel steel factory, a geothermal power plant, and the launch of the CN-235 aircraft (Roll-Out N-250 in Bandung, 1994).  </p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"a-rb-17-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-1959-2010-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-rb-17-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-1959-2010-fa-anri-tematis\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">a. RB 17. Inventory of Bacharuddin Jusuf Habibie\'s Textual Archives (1959-2010) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><div data-rte-anchor=\"a-rb-17-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-1959-2010-fa-anri-tematis-47-1\" id=\"a-rb-17-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-1959-2010-fa-anri-tematis-47-1\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 23.4667px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"16-prof-dr-ing-h-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-freng-1959-2010-video\" id=\"16-prof-dr-ing-h-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-freng-1959-2010-video\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Inter, Poppins, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">16. Prof. Dr. Eng. H. Bacharuddin Jusuf Habibie, FREng. </span></b><b style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; color: inherit;\">(1959 - 2010) Videos</b></p></div><p data-rte-anchor=\"a-fl-9-inventaris-arsip-video-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-1959-2010-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-fl-9-inventaris-arsip-video-bacharuddin-jusuf-habibie-1959-2010-fa-anri-tematis\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">a. FL 9. Inventory of Video Archives of Bacharuddin Jusuf Habibie (1959 - 2010) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</p><p data-rte-anchor=\"17-jacobus-hendrik-abendanon\" id=\"17-jacobus-hendrik-abendanon\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit; text-align: justify;\"><b style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">17. Jacobus Hendrik Abendanon</b></span></p><p data-rte-anchor=\"17-jacobus-hendrik-abendanon-69-1\" id=\"17-jacobus-hendrik-abendanon-69-1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; text-align: justify; color: inherit;\">a. K 64. Textual Archive Inventory J.H. Abendanon (1900-1925) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p></p></div>', 0, 'none', 'none', 1, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-07 07:54:46', '2026-06-07 12:46:11');
