etariat of the Republic of Indonesia (SETNEG RI) (1945-1949) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">b.RA 6B. Inventory of Textual Archives of the Republic of Indonesia State Secretariat (1945) 1959-1968 (1973) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">c. List of Textual Archives of the Republic of Indonesia State Secretariat Secretariat Series (1967) 1969-1999 [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">d. RA.15 List of Archives of President Sukarno\'s Speeches (1958-1967) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">e. RA 26. Inventory of Textual Archives of the State Secretariat: Indonesian National Police (1947-1949) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">f. RA 59G. List of Static Textual Archives of the Republic of Indonesia State Secretariat Legal Products Series 1949-2005 Volume 6 (Presidential Decrees - Government Organizers, Presidential Instructions) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">g. RA 59D, E, F. List of Static Textual Archives of the Republic of Indonesia State Secretariat Legal Products Series 1949-2005 Volumes 3, 4, 5 (Presidential Decrees - Government Administrators) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">h. RA 59C. List of Static Textual Archives of the Republic of Indonesia State Secretariat Legal Product Series 1949-2005 (Government Regulations, Presidential Decrees, Presidential Regulations) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">i. RA 59B. List of Static Textual Archives of the Republic of Indonesia State Secretariat: Legal Products Series 1949-2005 Volume I (Laws, Emergency Laws, Government Regulations in Lieu of Laws) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">j. F 70C. State Secretariat Photo Archives Inventory of the Presidential Palace Series 1954-2014 (Volume 3) [FA ANRI]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">k. F 70B. State Secretariat Photo Archives Inventory of the Presidential Palace Series 1954-2014 (Volume 2) [FA ANRI]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">l. F 70A. State Secretariat Photo Archives Inventory of the Presidential Palace Series 1954-2014 (Volume 1) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">m. F 42. Inventory of Photo Archives of the Republic of Indonesia State Secretariat (1966-1989) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">n. List of State Secretariat Video Archives 1973-1982 [FA ANRI]  [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">o. FL 7. List of Video Archives of the Republic of Indonesia State Secretariat for 1982 [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">p. List of Video Archives of the Republic of Indonesia State Secretariat 1950-1981 [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">q. List of 1972 State Secretariat Video Archives [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 23.4667px;\" data-rte-anchor=\"q-daftar-arsip-video-sekretariat-negara-1972-fa-anri-tematis2-kementerian-dalam-negeria-ra-17-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-kementerian-dalam-negeri-1945-1949-fa-anri-tematis3-kementerian-pertahanan\" id=\"q-daftar-arsip-video-sekretariat-negara-1972-fa-anri-tematis2-kementerian-dalam-negeria-ra-17-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-kementerian-dalam-negeri-1945-1949-fa-anri-tematis3-kementerian-pertahanan\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">2. Ministry of Home Affairs<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\">a. RA 17. Inventory of Textual Archives of the Ministry of Home Affairs (1945-1949) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: inherit;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Inter, Poppins, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">3. Ministry of Defense</span></b></span></p></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"a-ra-24-inventaris-arsip-statis-tekstual-kementerian-pertahanan-republik-indonesia-1945-1950-fa-anri-tematisb-ra-57i-daftar-arsip-tekstual-departemen-pertahanan-keamanan-seri-legiun-veteran-ri-daerah-pendaftaran-jawa-barat-1958-1992-fa-anri-c-ra-27b-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-departemen-angkatan-laut-1964-1967-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-ra-24-inventaris-arsip-statis-tekstual-kementerian-pertahanan-republik-indonesia-1945-1950-fa-anri-tematisb-ra-57i-daftar-arsip-tekstual-departemen-pertahanan-keamanan-seri-legiun-veteran-ri-daerah-pendaftaran-jawa-barat-1958-1992-fa-anri-c-ra-27b-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-departemen-angkatan-laut-1964-1967-fa-anri-tematis\">a. RA 24. Inventory of Textual Static Archives of the Ministry of Defense of the Republic of Indonesia (1945-1950) [FA ANRI] [THEMATIC]</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-rte-anchor=\"a-ra-24-inventaris-arsip-statis-tekstual-kementerian-pertahanan-republik-indonesia-1945-1950-fa-anri-tematisb-ra-57i-daftar-arsip-tekstual-departemen-pertahanan-keamanan-seri-legiun-veteran-ri-daerah-pendaftaran-jawa-barat-1958-1992-fa-anri-c-ra-27b-inventaris-arsip-tekstual-departemen-angkatan-laut-1964-1967-fa-anri-tematis\" id=\"a-ra-24-inventaris-arsip-statis-tekstual-kementerian-pertahanan-republik-indonesia-1945-1950-fa-anri-tematisb-ra-57i-daftar-arsip-tekstual-departemen-pertahanan-keamanan-seri-legiun-veteran-ri-daerah-pendafta