-1\" id=\"d-daftar-arsip-tekstual-residensi-buitenzorg-bogor-1729-1874-14-1\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"></span><b></b><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: Inter, Poppins, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">a. List of Textual Archives of the Buitenzorg-Bogor Residency 1729-1874</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; font-weight: 700;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 23.4667px;\" data-rte-anchor=\"e-daftar-arsip-tekstual-residensi-bantam-banten-1674-1891\" id=\"e-daftar-arsip-tekstual-residensi-bantam-banten-1674-1891\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Inter, Poppins, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">5. </span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"><b>Residentie Bantam</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 20.8px;\" data-rte-anchor=\"e-daftar-arsip-tekstual-residensi-bantam-banten-1674-1891-16-1\" id=\"e-daftar-arsip-tekstual-residensi-bantam-banten-1674-1891-16-1\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"></span><b></b><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 13px; font-family: Inter, Poppins, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;\">a. List of Textual Archives of the Bantam-Banten Residency (1674-1891)</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; font-weight: 700;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 23.4667px;\"></p>', 0, 'none', 'none', 1, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-06-07 09:51:16', '2026-06-07 12:39:34');
