round-color: rgb(13, 110, 253); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center; margin: 8px 0px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 0px 2px 4px;\\\">ANRI K.87F</a><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"></span></div>\", \"carousel_media_type\": \"images\", \"unified_image_order\": [{\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 0}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 1}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 2}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 3}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 4}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 5}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 6}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 7}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 8}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 9}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 10}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 11}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 12}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 13}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 14}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 15}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 16}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 17}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 18}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 19}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 20}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 21}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 22}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 23}, {\"type\": \"upload\", \"uploadIndex\": 24}], \"carousel_video_order\": []}', 3, '2026-05-26 06:49:37', '2026-06-03 06:59:12'),
(78, 72, 16, 'text_carousel', 'C. Produksi , Estimasi Produk, Pengolahan,  Pengujian Mutu Teh, dan Pengemasan Teh', 'C. Production, Product Estimation, Processing, Tea Quality Testing, and Tea Packaging', NULL, NULL, '<!--StartFragment--><p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"400\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tanaman teh mulai dipetik setelah berumur lebih dari dua tahun. Pemetikan dilakukan setiap 12 hari sekali dengan mengambil pucuk daun teh terbaik. Pekerjaan pemangkasan biasanya dilakukan laki-laki, sedangkan pemetikan dilakukan perempuan menggunakan alat seperti <em data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"324\">junak</em>, <em data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"334\">waring</em>, dan <em data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"346\">arit</em>. Setelah dipetik, daun teh langsung dibawa ke pabrik.</span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"641\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Di pabrik, daun teh diolah menjadi teh hitam, teh hijau, dan teh oolong melalui tiga tahap utama, yaitu pelayuan untuk mengurangi kadar air, penggulungan untuk membentuk daun, dan penggongsengan untuk menghasilkan aroma serta kualitas teh.</span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"817\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Setelah diolah, teh menjalani uji mutu untuk memastikan kualitasnya sebelum dipasarkan atau diekspor ke Eropa. Teh Jawa terkenal memiliki kualitas tinggi, terutama teh hijau.</span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"937\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Sebelum dikirim, teh dikemas menggunakan daun bambu kering agar kualitas dan aromanya tetap terjaga selama pengiriman.</span></p><!--EndFragment-->', '<!--StartFragment--><p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"400\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tea plants begin to be picked after they are more than two years old. Picking is done every 12 days by taking the best tea leaves. The pruning work is usually done by men, while the picking is done by women using tools such as <em data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"324\">junak</em>, <em data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"334\">waring</em>, and <em data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"346\">arit</em>. After being picked, the tea leaves are immediately taken to the factory.</span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"641\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">In the factory, tea leaves are processed into black tea, green tea, and oolong tea through three main stages, namely withering to reduce the water content, rolling to form the leaves, and roasting to produce the aroma and quality of the tea.</span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"817\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">After processing, tea undergoes quality testing to ensure its quality before being marketed or exported to Europe. Javanese tea is known for its high quality, especially green tea.</span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"937\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Before shipping, the tea is packaged using dry bamboo leaves so that the quality and aroma are maintained during shipping.</span></p><!--EndFragment-->', '[\"features/slideshow/gz3dy36ZCCztfKNhn6mMSoFCw93q9PZprsOptaK2.png\", \"features/slideshow/ZNGsdr8E8dOAnGtK7kkh2Sm5pL4y0g2Gr7txhc13.png\", \"features/slideshow/fBIG339dUKqdoBHNeOTGQB3WkJGJQWJS22i4ZKsM.png\", \"features/slideshow/XkKQKIAMH3UYaMLOtyvptS3f9J88G7uU5f5Bn5EN.png\", \"features/slideshow/xdEFrNTsXWgd8pkczQrndBZzq3BCncufVyi2ouaO.png\", \"features/slideshow/0KjLjLI8AauObwXeD3R6fIpg7KWcHFRxxE0MeK7P.png\", \"features/slideshow/2phX6KUoa9twGo2IM8912V64JwZ7ted2wsUT3Ldj.png\", \"features/slideshow/nePLF8AMrWjGIecmhrZzV6ppRMgwqKwKDt8tZ9T9.png\", \"features/slideshow/CDnUKw9ABp5Mjd5gBNB5uhGJkgkWxyaGGKvj2TCs.png\", \"features/slideshow/AqgmDdlYZ7S9t5fhw6Qa9BykesaYhFSma8XVdJY0.png\", \"features/slideshow/amFfBfxnO11a8GFVzCjVyvnxcN9xXKxUr2yd7Q1o.png\", \"features/slideshow/xzhlg8yBe3uwakWqoEFYNxuolF7Cs9DjW0RN2uP0.png\", \"features/slideshow/aeUtfY1sxZVNSiEU7ImY7FErtY8p3kcC3wLU9kNQ.png\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'right', '#ffffff', '{\"0\": \"<div style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">Seorang wanita pemetik teh di perkebunan teh, Jawa Barat, 1918.</div><a href=\\\"https://www.anri.go.id/download/daftar-arsip-foto-kit-jawa-barat-1930-1633327812\\\" class=\\\"rte-btn-link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" style=\\\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background-color: rgb(13, 110, 253); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center; margin: 8px 0px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 0px 2px 4px;\\\">ANRI F.15 KIT JAWA BARAT</a><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"></span>\", \"1\": \"<span style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\">Wanita pemetik teh di Pengalengan, Bandung, Jawa Barat.<br></span><a href=\\\"https://www.anri.go.id/download/daftar-arsip-foto-kit-jawa-barat-1930-1633327812\\\" class=\\\"rte-btn-link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" style=\\\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background-color: rgb(13, 110, 253); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center; margin: 8px 0px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 0px 2px 4px;\\\">ANRI F.15 KIT JAWA BARAT</a><span style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"><br><br></span>\", \"2\": \"<span style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\">Pemetik-pemetik teh berjalan beriringan menuju pabrik, Jawa Barat<br></span><a href=\\\"https://www.anri.go.id/download/daftar-arsip-foto-kit-jawa-barat-1930-1633327812\\\" class=\\\"rte-btn-link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" style=\\\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background-color: rgb(13, 110, 253); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center; margin: 8px 0px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 0px 2px 4px;\\\">ANR